<div class="eyebrow">LESS SEARCHING. MORE BUILDING.</div><h1>你的下一次搜索，<br>从这里开始。</h1><p class="intro">用 ripgrep 快速找到你需要的代码。<br>从安装到第一次搜索，只需几分钟、几行命令。</p><div class="hero-meta"><span><svg><use href="#book"/></svg>约 5 分钟</span><i class="divider"></i><span>macOS / Linux / Windows</span><i class="divider"></i><span>开源 · Rust 构建</span></div>
<div class="hero-terminal" aria-label="搜索效果示例"><div class="terminal-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="terminal-title">~/your-project — terminal</span></div><pre><span class="prompt">❯</span>rg -n "hello" src/
<span class="term-green">src/main.rs</span>
<span class="term-muted">3:</span>    println!("<span class="term-highlight">hello</span>, world!");
<span class="term-muted">8:</span>    let message = "<span class="term-highlight">hello</span>, ripgrep";</pre><span class="terminal-caption">SEARCH OUTPUT · EXAMPLE</span></div>
<div class="steps"><a class="step" href="#install"><small>01</small><strong>安装工具</strong><span class="arrow">→</span></a><a class="step" href="#configuration"><small>02</small><strong>按需配置</strong><span class="arrow">→</span></a><a class="step" href="#commands"><small>03</small><strong>开始搜索</strong><span class="arrow">→</span></a></div>
<section id="install"><div class="section-heading"><span class="number">01</span><h2>安装 ripgrep</h2></div><p class="section-note">选择你的操作系统，在终端中运行对应的安装命令。</p><div class="install-box"><div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="操作系统"><button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-macos" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="install-panel" data-platform="macos">macOS</button><button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-linux" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="install-panel" tabindex="-1" data-platform="linux">Linux</button><button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-windows" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="install-panel" tabindex="-1" data-platform="windows">Windows</button><button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-cargo" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="install-panel" tabindex="-1" data-platform="cargo">Cargo</button></div><div class="install-body" role="tabpanel" id="install-panel" aria-labelledby="tab-macos"><div class="platform-note" id="platform-note">使用 <a href="https://brew.sh/">Homebrew</a> 安装，需先安装 Homebrew。</div><div class="code-row"><pre><span class="dollar" aria-hidden="true">$</span><code id="install-command">brew install ripgrep</code></pre><button class="copy" data-copy="install-command" aria-label="复制安装命令"><svg><use href="#copy"/></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="verify"><svg><use href="#check"/></svg><span>运行 <code class="inline-code">rg --version</code>，显示版本号即表示安装成功。</span></div></section>
<section id="configuration"><div class="section-heading"><span class="number">02</span><h2>让它更顺手</h2><span class="optional">可选配置</span></div><p class="section-note">开箱即用，也可以保存常用选项。以下示例适用于 macOS / Linux 的 Bash 或 Zsh。</p><div class="config-code"><div class="code-label"><span>~/.ripgreprc</span><button class="copy" data-copy="config-content" aria-label="复制配置内容"><svg><use href="#copy"/></svg></button></div><pre><code id="config-content"><span class="code-comment"># 搜索结果显示行号</span>
--line-number
<span class="code-comment"># 全小写查询忽略大小写，含大写时精确匹配</span>
--smart-case</code></pre></div><p class="section-note" style="margin:13px 0 10px">新建上述文件并保存内容，然后在终端中设置配置路径：</p><div class="config-code"><div class="code-row" style="padding:12px 15px"><pre style="padding:0"><code id="config-export">export RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH="$HOME/.ripgreprc"</code></pre><button class="copy" data-copy="config-export" aria-label="复制环境变量命令"><svg><use href="#copy"/></svg></button></div></div><div class="callout"><svg><use href="#info"/></svg><p>希望每次打开终端都生效？将这行 <code>export</code> 加入 <code>~/.zshrc</code> 或 <code>~/.bashrc</code>，再打开新终端。ripgrep 通过 <code>RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH</code> 读取配置。</p></div></section>
<section id="commands"><div class="section-heading"><span class="number">03</span><h2>三个命令，覆盖日常</h2></div><p class="section-note">进入你的项目目录，试试下面这些最常用的搜索方式。</p><div class="commands"><article class="command" id="search-text"><div class="command-top"><span class="command-index">01</span><h3>在项目中搜索文本</h3><span class="tag">SEARCH</span></div><p>递归查找 TODO；默认遵循 .gitignore，并跳过隐藏文件。</p><div class="code-row"><pre><span class="dollar" aria-hidden="true">$</span><code id="cmd-text">rg -n "TODO" .</code></pre><button class="copy" data-copy="cmd-text" aria-label="复制搜索文本命令"><svg><use href="#copy"/></svg></button></div></article><article class="command" id="search-logs"><div class="command-top"><span class="command-index">02</span><h3>快速定位日志中的异常</h3><span class="tag">FILTER</span></div><p>忽略大小写，搜索 error 或 warn 并显示行号。将 logs/ 替换为你的日志目录。</p><div class="code-row"><pre><span class="dollar" aria-hidden="true">$</span><code id="cmd-logs">rg -n -i '"'error|warn' logs/</code></pre><button class=\"copy\" data-copy=\"cmd-logs\" aria-label=\"复制筛选日志命令\"><svg><use href=\"#copy\"/></svg></button></div></article><article class=\"command\" id=\"search-files\"><div class=\"command-top\"><span class=\"command-index\">03</span><h3>只查找你关心的文件</h3><span class=\"tag\">FILES</span></div><p>列出 TypeScript 文件路径，排除 node_modules 目录。</p><div class=\"code-row\"><pre><span class=\"dollar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">"'$</span><code id="cmd-files">rg --files -g '"'*.ts' -g '"'!node_modules'"'</code></pre><button class=\"copy\" data-copy=\"cmd-files\" aria-label=\"复制查找文件命令\"><svg><use href=\"#copy\"/></svg></button></div></article></div><div class=\"callout\"><svg><use href=\"#info\"/></svg><p>没有结果？先检查路径和忽略规则；需要搜索隐藏文件时加入 <code>--hidden</code>，需要跳过忽略规则时加入 <code>--no-ignore</code>。</p></div></section>
